\newlabel{fig:quiet_contam_theta}{{8}{29}{Left and center: mean \(\hat \theta _{0,A}\) error versus contamination magnitude for Types 1 and 2. Right: fraction of replicates with anchored \(\mathrm {KCOR}_\infty >1\) on the combined \(4\times 4\) grid (joint contamination), using the fifth accumulating week as the reference. The frailty error bars show one standard deviation across simulations}{figure.caption.71}{}}
